        "Platform considerations",
        "iPadOS",
        "Pointer shape and content effects"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "094f01c94c881e97973250a2ff2daf674c53dd79c6f57cc2d47926e662c0a0b4",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Pointer accessories",
      "section_path": [
        "Pointing devices",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iPadOS",
        "Pointer accessories"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "10eec96bce2a9a4a609287bf17d57b876427ade1873fe1af7d966d24e112c7d5",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Use clear, simple images to create custom accessories",
      "section_path": [
        "Pointing devices",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iPadOS",
        "Pointer accessories"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "9eb01c26ac04033f8dfee44af85beebbdebb11cca06aac53ba7a0fe0ff392873",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider using the accessory transition to signal a change in an element’s state or behavior",
      "section_path": [
        "Pointing devices",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iPadOS",
        "Pointer accessories"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "d3df1bdf0cf67a28f75f61b0c027967737c708a507a991143bb85e2d9b3130b0",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "Pointer magnetism",
      "section_path": [
