        "Standard pointers and effects"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "0aac0c5f547b8ba572d6aa8ad12f83cc64263c3c44704b56a92dd2039642667e",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "When possible, support the system-provided content effects",
      "section_path": [
        "Pointing devices",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iPadOS",
        "Standard pointers and effects"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "63c81c9a62ac58d3e00f45d65914c2d8683c180e8b74d9aea593541bc89187ee",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Prefer the system-provided pointer appearances for standard buttons and text-entry areas",
      "section_path": [
        "Pointing devices",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iPadOS",
        "Standard pointers and effects"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "e09bb38c82d8ff74ceb9f54d82d0dd8f59b9112d476e8cacd8e5d35710bb4947",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Add padding around interactive elements to create comfortable hit regions",
      "section_path": [
        "Pointing devices",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iPadOS",
        "Standard pointers and effects"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "9c42868b483070789fed335e899facc37aa292f92ba19ec2c3cfa45ff89950c7",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Create contiguous hit regions for custom bar buttons",
      "section_path": [
        "Pointing devices",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iPadOS",
        "Standard pointers and effects"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "4645993ee92b79e04c09f9abe0f96cee66e550f33c54139085c4fdd595eed08c",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Specify the corner radius of a nonstandard element that receives the lift effect",
      "section_path": [
        "Pointing devices",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iPadOS",
        "Standard pointers and effects"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "2d4becd5c3308240852c5bf14ba6538ae496f017a5b1ada6a3df7877dfe307af",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Customizing pointers",
      "section_path": [
        "Pointing devices",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iPadOS",
        "Customizing pointers"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "2692fde1ed739422ac7af774b80bcd04ddc4fc852a6d4412a708594bb45f2b7a",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Prefer system-provided pointer effects for custom elements that behave like standard elements",
      "section_path": [
        "Pointing devices",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iPadOS",
        "Customizing pointers"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "5b984033c2ee618a0aa10b33c6673ef535366d9d953c14da9ff343f731e60dfc",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Use pointer effects in consistent ways throughout your app",
      "section_path": [
        "Pointing devices",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iPadOS",
        "Customizing pointers"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "dcace2737d7f8bbbfdb025dca018ab1b6976793ac925ae97be01c7d8a88faefb",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid creating gratuitous pointer and content effects",
      "section_path": [
        "Pointing devices",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iPadOS",
        "Customizing pointers"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "9ca3aee0642349c490ed5489c2fb17d98db2e4839b3a00bd22a6819861f8af63",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Keep custom pointer shapes simple",
      "section_path": [
        "Pointing devices",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iPadOS",
        "Customizing pointers"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "345ec3788df87ac8e003441874e1db2d9781b92c38a44c0710c34bd29d31cbe3",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider enhancing the pointer experience by displaying custom annotations that provide useful information",
      "section_path": [
        "Pointing devices",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iPadOS",
        "Customizing pointers"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "8a11555eb2bfcf6239523dfdb1efa6b8ea9f652af978b7385252941b1affb685",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid displaying instructional text with a pointer",
      "section_path": [
        "Pointing devices",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iPadOS",
        "Customizing pointers"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "f4b2da87c5f45d4a8dc4dd7cafa7d5ab54ce2a1d29abdc4a4336a4a33e81da22",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider the interplay of shadow, scale, and element spacing when defining custom hover effects",
      "section_path": [
        "Pointing devices",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iPadOS",
        "Customizing pointers"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "cb27b9c9381861b5d68c2045a5cc93835a0ee54a82bcd231f029abd3111d4634",
